%###########################################
% Parameters  of our new Wiedemann-26 model
%###########################################
%  
8	 lveh       vehicle length [m]
%
35	 v0         desired speed
3	 s0	    minimum gap [m]
0.9	 T1 	    time gap lower bound following region RCF [s]     
1.8	 T2	    time gap upper bound following region [s]
2	 dv0	    half-width rel speed [m/s] at lower RCF bound
1000	 tau_a	    speed relaxation time [s]
2	 a0	    max accel. [m/s^2]
2	 b	    comf decel. [m/s^2]
8	 bmax 	    max decel. [m/s^2] (overridden by system?)
0	 use_vl	    0=false: use s0+T1*v etc, 1=true: s0+T1*vl
1	 indiff	    indifference factor in [0.1] (default 1)